      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Pixel Art (Transparent BG) — read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pixel Art Generation + Background Removal\n\nBased on the built-in Z-Image-Turbo text-to-image template, with a\nbackground-removal chain appended so the saved PNG already has a real\nalpha channel — no separate flood-fill/chroma-key pass needed.\n\nWrite prompts using the retro pixel-art formulas in this project's\n`docs/ASSET_GUIDE.md` — ending with a plain, roughly-solid dark\nbackground (the subject-isolation model works on any background, but a\nclean one gives the cleanest cutout). Tileable ground/wall textures\n(no background to remove) should still use `image_z_image_turbo`\ndirectly, not this workflow.\n\nSame model links as the base template:\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)\n\n**Background removal model** (auto-downloads on first run if missing)\n\n- birefnet.safetensors\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
